#: forms.py:131
msgid ""
"Answers to these yes/no and multiple-choice questions are counted on the "
"Operations page. Only the chosen option is stored — never free text. Avoid "
"questions about health or other sensitive topics unless you have a legal "
"basis. Changes apply after the next resync."
